      "widgets_values": [
        "# Wan Animate 2 (24GB local)\n\n- **UNET**: `wan_animate_2_int8_convrot.safetensors` (~16 GB, fits 4090)\n- **Speed**: LightX2V LoRA + LCM **6 steps**, CFG 1.0\n- **Cache**: `cpu` / `int8` (do not put cache on GPU at 24 GB)\n- Prompt = look + background only. Motion comes from the driving video.\n- Match framing (full-body to full-body). First pose of the still should match the video start.\n"
